---
description: Enter the cross-repository Harness before planning or modifying registered repositories.
alwaysApply: true
---

Start with the control repository's `AGENTS.md`, `repos.yaml`, `docs/harness/inventory.md`, and `.agents/PLANS.md`.

For any task that changes a non-control repository, create or update a cross-repository ExecPlan before implementation. Follow only the write paths authorised by that plan, preserve provider/consumer truth ownership, verify repositories independently, and record integration outcomes in the control repository.

Do not modify unregistered siblings or treat the Harness as permission for publishing, deployment, access changes, destructive operations, or external data mutation.
